Package: net.ergm.v4plus
Type: Project
Title: hepcep ergm fit, simulation, diagnostics 
Version: 0.0.1
Depends: R (>= 4.5.1)
Imports:
    dplyr,
    ergm,
    ergm.userterms,
    ergm.userterms.hepcep,
    ggplot2,
    here,
    network,
    qs,
    qs2,
    styler
Suggests:
    igraph,
    intergraph,
    jsonlite
Note: This DESCRIPTION file exists to support renv "explicit" snapshots.
    It allows us to control dependency discovery in an HPC setting by
    avoiding recursive scans of large output directories (e.g.,
    slurm_output), and makes package dependencies explicit and
    reproducible. Imports lists the pipeline packages, which renv
    snapshots; Suggests lists the network-visualization prototypes,
    which it does not.
